# The define sets of default/main.vert with a Slang twin (task 0072, stage f): what the GLSL compiles with (the Mode
# defines the stage imports), and for a set with TEXCOORD or PARTICLE the pipeline's count of texture coordinate sets
# (UVSETS_<n>, vsgUtil::uvSetsDefine). The content decides most names, so the sets are open-ended; these are the ones
# the default settings and the common profiles create, confirmed with OPENEDEN_SHADER_TRACE. Any other set draws with
# the GLSL. Lines are canonical (sorted, "-" for none).
#
# Traced (OPENEDEN_SHADER_TRACE, task 0072 stage f) with the default settings; hdr, pbr, gbuffer, gi, ao, sss, atmosphere
# and gi exterior; object, actor and player shadows; the weather (hdr, pbr, wetness and puddles, cover, cloud and
# volumetric cloud shadows, precipitation lighting, soft particles, weather particle occlusion) in cloudy, rain and ash
# weather; pbr material maps with parallax low, medium and high on the local Faultier stand-ins; object clusters in the
# map view; antialiasing 4 with alpha to coverage; pbr look physical; in Balmora, Seyda Neen by day and night, the
# Caldera Guild of Mages and the Ashlands.
COLOR GBUFFER_MOTION NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR LOD_SWAY NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR MORPH NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL NORMAL_MAP TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL VERTEX
ENV_MAP NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
GBUFFER_MOTION NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
MORPH NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL NORMAL_MAP TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL SKIN VERTEX
NORMAL TEXCOORD TEXMAT UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL VERTEX
PARTICLE SOFT_PARTICLE UVSETS_1
PARTICLE UVSETS_1

#
# the sets of the living test profile that the list above lacked (task 0072, stage j, 2026-11-06).
COLOR GBUFFER_MOTION NORMAL NORMAL_MAP SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
#
# Task 0072, stage j (2026-11-06): skinned objects with an environment map, the same scene (a traced set of the test profile).
ENV_MAP GBUFFER_MOTION NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
#
# Task 0153 follow-up 2 (2026-11-13): the Skyrim neutral grass (instances with a colour and a sway speed), a traced set.
COLOR INSTANCE INSTANCE_TINT NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
#
# Not listed on purpose: COLOR NORMAL TEXCOORD TEXMAT UVSETS_1 VERTEX (a test of the run-time compiler, SlangRuntimeLibrary.sets_the_build_never_listed_pass_through_the_production_check_with_an_exact_count, needs it unlisted; the profile makes it, so it compiles at run time).
